sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Student as Student portal
    participant BFF as Next.js BFF
    participant API as Spring assistant
    participant DB as PostgreSQL knowledge
    participant AI as Approved model provider
    Student->>BFF: Ask about a class
    BFF->>API: Authenticated question (server token)
    API->>DB: Resolve signed-in student and active scopes
    DB-->>API: Verified eligible scopes
    alt Scope ambiguous
        API-->>BFF: CLARIFICATION with allowed choices
    else Scope selected and authorized
        API->>DB: Search published, effective, scoped chunks
        DB-->>API: Authorized passages + citation IDs
        opt Passages available and current
            API->>AI: Minimal permitted evidence and question
            AI-->>API: Draft answer + citation IDs
        end
        API->>DB: Recheck published versions and access
        alt Supported and cited
            API-->>BFF: ANSWERED and valid citations
        else Missing, revoked, conflicting or unsafe
            API-->>BFF: NO_SOURCE or ESCALATE
        end
    end
    BFF-->>Student: Answer / choice / staff fallback
